id: pm-ok2kdn
title: Agent-task token replay trusts missing or incorrect accounting estimates
description: CodeRabbit exact-head review on PR #1133 found that the replay gate validates receipt total_bytes but copies total_estimated_tokens without requiring it or proving ceil(total_bytes/4). Missing or incorrect estimates can understate per-task and composite usage despite finite baseline ceilings.
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags[5]: "area:quality","area:release",review-feedback,testing,token-efficiency
created_at: "2026-08-27T20:29:34.879Z"
updated_at: "2026-08-27T21:32:16.299Z"
closed_at: "2026-08-27T21:31:56.227Z"
completed_at: "2026-08-27T21:31:56.227Z"
author: "harness:codex"
acceptance_criteria: "Accounting receipts require finite integer total_estimated_tokens equal to ceil(baseline bytes/4); missing, low, high, nonfinite, and malformed estimates fail closed; replay and negative controls pass"
parent: pm-8pnj
risk: high
confidence: high
severity: high
resolution: Required and independently recomputed exact receipt token estimates before task and composite replay aggregation.
expected_result: Task and composite token totals are derived only from contract-valid accounting receipts.
actual_result: The replay gate now requires a finite integer total_estimated_tokens receipt and independently proves exact equality with ceil(total_bytes/4) before task or composite aggregation.
component: release-token-gate
