comments[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-27T20:29:34.879Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check evidence: the all-status estimated-token receipt search found the canonical token-budget and pm-8pnj lineages plus prior finite-ceiling child pm-aksavu, but no item for receipt estimate integrity. Review source: CodeRabbit on PR #1133 head baae93c."
  "2026-08-27T21:13:29.288Z","harness:codex","Evidence 2026-08-27: missing, low, high, NaN, Infinity, and string total_estimated_tokens negative controls all fail closed; the focused gate and canonical replay pass. Repository exact coverage passed 8,067/8,067 tests at 100/100/100/100, and the replay reports five tasks, 14 steps, two retries, and 4,349 estimated tokens from independently validated receipts."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-27T21:13:29.905Z","harness:codex",Validating transport bytes but trusting the adjacent token estimate leaves the budget gate forgeable. Every derived accounting field used for aggregation must be independently recomputed and equality-checked before consumption.
